Z||000001||BAM-BAM||08-03-2000||12:08 AM||||    Try your local dealer. I just bought one in Feb. it was $40.00. It is possible that it is dicontinued, if so then the junk yard is your best bet. I'll call my parts lady tomorrow and see if they are still available. If you have trouble finding one I might be able to help you out. E-Mail me if you have trouble.<P> Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||12
